# Code quality

- Format/lint with **Biome** (don’t mix ESLint+Prettier on the same tree unless documented)
- Run **Knip** for unused exports/deps as part of `check`
- No unexplained `any` or `@ts-ignore`
- Keep `build`, `lint`, `typecheck`, `test`, `test:e2e` green in CI

Details: `docs/frontend/tools/CODE_QUALITY.md`
